      "date": "2026-02-12T12:57:34.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹0.12 loss per share (vs ₹26.68 profit in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.12 loss per share (down from ₹26.68 profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹900.8m (down 47% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹4.37m (down 100% from profit in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 69 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
